5. PROHIBITED COMMERCIALIZATION

You may NOT:

(a) sell the Original Base by itself;

(b) sell an unchanged copy of the Original Base;

(c) sell a renamed copy of the Original Base;

(d) sell a rebranded copy of the Original Base;

(e) sell the Original Base with only trivial or cosmetic modifications;

(f) place the Original Base behind a paywall;

(g) charge money solely for access to the Original Base;

(h) claim that the Original Base is your own original creation;

(i) remove the original attribution for the purpose of making the Base
